// questions, the GlanceCard rows and FORA's fixed cells) come from
// src/data/content-marketplaces.ts. A claim cites its source inline, as a
// link, or with cite(N), which links to entry N of the numbered SourceList;
// SOURCES below is numbered in order of first citation, so an entry's
// position is its number. Text with links is HTML and goes through set:html.
