  [`No outside buyer does. PerplexityBot and third-party crawlers build Perplexity's own index ${cite(5, 6)}.`, `An agent asks your Exchange, or a Broker, which returns your signed offers unchanged (${a('/resources/content-marketplaces/#broker-order', 'how a Broker orders offers')}) ${cite(24)}.`],
  [`Two crawlers, known by name and published IP ranges ${cite(5)}. Perplexity's crawler docs describe no request signatures, and its site serves no signing-key directory ${cite(5, 8)}. Comet Assistant is meant to be "indistinguishable from you" ${cite(7)}.`, `Each request carries a signature, checked against a key the buyer publishes on its own domain (Web Bot Auth, the IETF working group's -00 draft) ${cite(20, 25)}.`],
  [`The contract. PerplexityBot follows robots.txt; Perplexity-User, which fetches pages for a user, "generally ignores robots.txt rules" ${cite(5, 6)}.`, `A signed offer the agent accepts and signs, and a signed link that expires, checked at your CDN ${cite(20)}.`],
  [`Perplexity: the pool, its own cut ("a small portion"; 20% in press reports) and each partner's weights. You set no price ${cite(1, 12)}.`, `You: free, per unit (an access, or text tokens, about ¾ of a word each) or a flat fee, signed on each offer. A revenue share is a term priced at zero that only agents naming the deal see, with a reporting duty (${a('/protocol/licensing-terms/#revenue-share-arrangements', 'Revenue share')}).`],
  [`Perplexity pays from the pool, by its own account. Schedule, threshold and currency aren't published ${cite(1)}.`, FORA_CELLS.money],
  [`2024 partners got analytics on how Perplexity cites them ${cite(3)}. No Comet Plus statement format is published ${cite(1, 2)}.`, `Each sale, with its signed offer and the agent's signed acceptance, in your Exchange operator's console (FORA Server's shows gross, fee and net). No protocol call returns your sales ${cite(19)}.`],
  [`No dispute process is published. Publishers' disagreements with Perplexity have gone to court; see <a href="#legal">For legal</a> ${cite(9, 15, 16)}.`, FORA_CELLS.disputes],
]);

const WORKS_TODAY = [
